		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Skeletal champion, once a warlord or general. Armored in black chainmail, drags a burden of heavy iron chains.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (chain), <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 chain (near) +5 (2d4 + flense), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Aura of Whispers</strong>. Mortals within near who behold, WIS 15+ or terrified 1d4 rounds. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flense</strong>. First chain attack per turn does +2d4 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
